---
// 網站本身的隱私政策(xarts.games 與站上的網頁遊戲)。
//
// 跟 /privacy 是兩份不同的東西:那一份寫的是 CatInsight Stock 這個 iOS App
// 的資料處理,涵蓋不到網站。AdSense 審核會看「這個網站」有沒有揭露廣告
// Cookie 與第三方廣告商,拿 App 的政策去頂會被退。
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout title="Website Privacy Policy - X-Arts" current="privacy"
                brand="X-Arts" brandAccent="Games" icon="assets/favicon.png">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="legal card">
    <h1>Website <span class="grad">Privacy Policy</span></h1>
    <div class="upd">Last updated: August 2026</div>

    <p>This page covers the website at <b>xarts.games</b> and the browser games hosted on it,
    including Tiny Planet. Our iOS app CatInsight Stock has its own separate policy.</p>

    <h2>No Account, No Sign-In</h2>
    <p>You can browse this site and play the games without creating an account. We never ask
    for your name, email address, phone number, or any other directly identifying information,
    and there is no login of any kind.</p>

    <h2>Stored on Your Device</h2>
    <p>The games save a few preferences in your browser's local storage so the game remembers
    them next time: your chosen aircraft colour, interface language, and whether music is on.
    These stay in your browser. They are never sent to us and never used to identify you.
    Clearing your browser data removes them.</p>

    <h2>Multiplayer</h2>
    <p>While you fly in Tiny Planet, your aircraft's position, orientation, and colour are sent
    to our relay server so other players in the air can see your plane, and theirs is sent to
    you. The server holds these only in memory for as long as your connection is open, forwards
    them to the other players currently connected, and writes nothing to disk. Each connection
    gets a sequential number for the duration of the session; it is not tied to you and is
    discarded when you disconnect. No chat, no usernames, no history.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count page views and see which pages are popular.
    It is cookie-free and does not fingerprint or track individual visitors across sites.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>We may display advertising on this site through Google AdSense.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior
      visits to this website or other websites.</li>
      <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you
      based on your visit to this and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
      <li>You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
      <a class="mail" href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a>.
      You can also opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalised
      advertising at <a class="mail" href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
      <li>Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, and Switzerland are shown
      a consent prompt before any advertising or measurement cookies are set, and can change
      or withdraw that choice at any time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Payments and Donations</h2>
    <p>Donations are handled entirely by Stripe on their own checkout page. Your card details
    are entered on Stripe's page and are never seen by, sent to, or stored by us.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect personal
    information from them. Advertising served on this site is not personalised for users we
    have reason to believe are children.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We keep no personal data, so there is nothing for us to retain or delete on request.
    Preferences live in your browser until you clear them; multiplayer position data exists
    only for the length of your session.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this page from time to time. The date at the top reflects the most recent
    revision.</p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email
    <a class="mail" href="mailto:contact@xarts.games">contact@xarts.games</a>.</p>
  </div></div>
</SubpageLayout>
